  "ps3.8:0.3": "3. 8. satipaṭṭhāna kathā ",
  "ps3.8:1.1": "[sāvatthinidānaṃ] ",
  "ps3.8:1.2": "‘cattārome bhikkhave, satipaṭṭhānā, ",
  "ps3.8:1.3": "katame cattāro: ",
  "ps3.8:1.4": "idha bhikkhave, bhikkhu kāye kāyānupassī viharati ātāpi sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṃ. ",
  "ps3.8:1.5": "vedanāsu …pe… ",
  "ps3.8:1.6": "citte …pe… ",
  "ps3.8:1.7": "dhammesu dhammānupassī viharati ātāpi sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṃ. ",
  "ps3.8:1.8": "ime kho bhikkhave, cattāro satipaṭṭhānāti”. ",
  "ps3.8:2.1": "kathaṃ kāye kaṃyānupassī viharati: ",
  "ps3.8:2.2": "idhekacco paṭhavīkāyaṃ aniccato anupassati no niccato, ",
  "ps3.8:2.3": "dukkhato anupassati no sukhato, ",
  "ps3.8:2.4": "anattato anupassati no attato, ",
  "ps3.8:2.5": "nibbindati no nandati, ",
  "ps3.8:2.6": "virajjati no rajjati, ",
  "ps3.8:2.7": "nirodheti no samudeti, paṭinissajjati no ādiyati. ",
  "ps3.8:2.8": "aniccato anupassanto niccasaññaṃ pajahati, dukkhato anupassanto sukhasaññaṃ pajahati, anattato anupassanto attasaññaṃ pajahati, nibbindanto nandiṃ pajahati, virajjanto rāgaṃ pajahati, nirodhento samudayaṃ pajahati, paṭinissajjanto ādānaṃ pajahati. ",
  "ps3.8:2.9": "imehi sattahi ākārehi kāyaṃ anupassati. ",
  "ps3.8:2.10": "kāyo upaṭṭhānaṃ no sati. ",
  "ps3.8:2.11": "sati upaṭṭhānañce va sati ca, ",
  "ps3.8:2.12": "tāya satiyā tena ñāṇena taṃ kāyaṃ anupassati. ",
  "ps3.8:2.13": "tena vuccati: ",
  "ps3.8:2.14": "kāye kāyānupassanā satipaṭṭhānā. ",
  "ps3.8:3.1": "bhāvanāti catasso bhāvanā: ",
  "ps3.8:3.2": "tattha jātānaṃ dhammānaṃ anativattanaṭṭhena bhāvanā, indriyānaṃ ekarasaṭṭhena bhāvanā, tadupagaviriyavāhanaṭṭhena bhāvanā, āsevananaṭṭhena bhāvanā. ",
  "ps3.8:4.1": "idhekacco …pe… ",
