  "ps3.8:5.2": "tattha jātānaṃ dhammānaṃ anativattanaṭṭhena bhāvanā, indriyānaṃ ekarasaṭṭhena bhāvanā, tadupagaviriyavāhanaṭṭhena bhāvanā, asevanaṭṭhena bhāvanā ",
  "ps3.8:5.3": "evaṃ kāye kāyānupassī viharati. ",
